From: shaohong.dong <shaohong.dong.cq@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] telemetry: include cstdint for MavlinkSystem

The routing header declares uint8_t fields but depends on standard library
headers including the integer type definitions indirectly. Include cstdint
explicitly to compile with GCC 15.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: shaohong.dong <shaohong.dong.cq@gmail.com>
---
 OpenHD/ohd_telemetry/src/routing/MavlinkSystem.hpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/OpenHD/ohd_telemetry/src/routing/MavlinkSystem.hpp b/OpenHD/ohd_telemetry/src/routing/MavlinkSystem.hpp
--- a/OpenHD/ohd_telemetry/src/routing/MavlinkSystem.hpp
+++ b/OpenHD/ohd_telemetry/src/routing/MavlinkSystem.hpp
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@
 #ifndef OPENHD_OPENHD_OHD_TELEMETRY_SRC_ROUTING_MAVLINKSYSTEM_H_
 #define OPENHD_OPENHD_OHD_TELEMETRY_SRC_ROUTING_MAVLINKSYSTEM_H_
 
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <map>
 #include <memory>
 #include <vector>
